# Folders the AI must never write into. One shell glob per line; blank lines and
# #-comments ignored. Matched against the full file path, so patterns want the
# leading and trailing */ ... /* form.
#
# This file REPLACES the hook's built-in defaults rather than adding to them, so
# list everything you want blocked. The two below are the defaults; keep them
# unless you mean to drop them.
#
# Add ` | move-in` after a glob to make that folder an archive: the AI may MOVE a
# file into it (vault_move, onto a name that does not exist yet), and everything
# else there stays read-only. E.g.  */Archive/* | move-in
#
# Never exported: your folder names describe your vault.
# Keep it in step with the read-only section of maps/vault-map.md.
*/Archive/*
*/Attachments/*
# Add your own, e.g. plugin data folders:
# */copilot/*
